{c: Verse 1}
[F#m]Pucho na mujhse [D]kahani [F#m]meri,        [F#m]Kaisi rahi zind [D]agani [F#m]meri
[F#m]Puchona [C#m]muzse [D]kahani [F#m]meri,        [F#m]Kaisi rahi zind [D]agani [F#m]meri
[Bm]Ambar ke sare [D]sitaaron se bhi,        [F#m]Apne [Bm]ghar aur [E]diwaro se [F#m]bhi
[F#m]Rakhi chupakar [D]nishani [F#m]teri,        [F#m]Pucho na [C#m]mujhse [D]kahani [F#m]meri
[F#m]Kaisi rahi zind [D]agani [F#m]meri,        [F#m]Na chahu duaayein, na chahu [G]dilasa
